<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad.\rClair, our Block Boss, went in the\nDragon’s Den behind the Block.\rNo idea when she comin’ back. She don’t\ntell nobody nothin’. She a diva.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair waitin’ on you.\rBut a regular-degular Hustler ain’t\ngot a chance. She’ll eat you alive.\fAnd then complain about the taste.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You beat CLAIR?! That’s CRAZY!\rI never heard of her losin’ to nobody\nbut Lance! She gon’ be in a MOOD for\fweeks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Nah. Only chosen Hustlers can train\nhere. You ain’t chosen. Bounce.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If Clair cool with it, her grandpa--\nour Master--cool with it too.\rCome in.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My radio broke?\nI only get this weird signal now.\fIt’s just laughin’. Creepy laughin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AROOO! Voices in my head!\rHuh? Oh, it’s my radio! Whew. I thought\nit was the voices again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You finna make your homies forget some\nmoves?\rThe Move Deleter ALWAYS remember to\ncharge you though. Funny how that\fwork.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Them Hustlers called Drama Queens all\ncome from Blackthorn City.\rThe drama is in the water here.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, you came through the ICE PATH?\rYou must be a REAL hotshot Hustler!\nOr you got good shoes. Either way.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blackthorn City\nA Quiet Mountain Spot. Dragons.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blackthorn City Block\nBoss: Clair\fThe Dragon Queen. Just Ask Her.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Move Deleter and Move Tutor House\rMake Your Homies Forget and\nRemember Moves. No Refunds.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Dragon’s Den Ahead</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0629_T30_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hustler Tips\rWild homies show up regular\nif you walk quiet in the\ftall grass instead of runnin’.\rIf your crew tired, don’t\nrun around, go straight\fto a Trap House.</language>
	</row>
</body>
